  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/2C3EBB">Proposition <span data-tag="2C3EBB">7.1.2.3</span>.</a> The adjoint functors $(||_{X}, \Sing _ X)$ determine a (simplicial) Quillen adjunction between $\Top _{/X}$ (with the model structure of Proposition <a href="/tag/619B0D" data-tag="619B0D">7.1.2.1</a> ) and $\Set _{\Delta }^{\calB ^{op}}$ (with the projective model structure). </p>
